        "t_mail": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "truck",
            "icon_width": 20,
            "text": "Prepaid return envelope included. No additional lab fee.",
            "text_size": "text-base"
          }
        },
        "t_account": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "icon_width": 20,
            "text": "Results in 2–4 weeks, saved to your Seatopia account",
            "text_size": "text-base"
          }
        },
        "tab_includes": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "style": "with-background",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "heading": "What’s included in your results",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "opened": false,
            "content": "<p>The Omega-3 Index; omega ratios (total omega-6 to omega-3, and arachidonic acid (AA) to EPA); the Trans Fat Index, a measure of industrially produced trans fats in whole blood; and dietary tables. Results are appropriate for the general adult population.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_instructions": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "style": "with-background",
            "icon": "support",
            "heading": "Collection instructions",
            "page": "",
            "opened": false,
            "content": "",
            "liquid": "<ol>\n<li>Remove all components from the small plastic bag. Locate the collection card with the barcode on the front.</li>\n<li>Register the test kit on our <a href=\"/pages/omegaindex\">Omega Index page</a> using the barcode on the collection card. You will not receive your results unless it is registered.</li>\n<li>Fill out the information requested on the collection card.</li>\n<li>Improve blood flow before the finger prick: wash your hands in warm water, then stand and shake your hand at your side.</li>\n<li>Clean the tip of the finger (index, middle or ring) with the alcohol wipe. Let the alcohol dry on its own.</li>\n<li>Twist off the blue protective lancet cover. Place the lancet lightly on the tip of your clean finger and press down firmly until you hear a click.</li>\n<li>Wipe away the first drop of blood with the gauze.</li>\n<li>Gently squeeze the finger so a blood drop forms. This can take 15–30 seconds, so be patient.</li>\n<li>Let the blood drop fall from your finger onto the center circle of the collection card.</li>\n<li>When the blood spot is collected, press the gauze pad on your finger and bandage the prick site.</li>\n<li>Let the blood spot dry with the flap open for several minutes, then fold the flap over the dried spot.</li>\n<li>Place the collection card in the plastic bag and seal it. Put the bag in the prepaid return envelope and mail it the same day.</li>\n<li>Discard the lancet and other supplies in the trash.</li>\n</ol>"
          }
        },
        "tab_register": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "style": "with-background",
            "icon": "rocket",
            "heading": "Register your kit",
            "page": "",
            "opened": false,
            "content": "",
            "liquid": "<p>Before you mail your sample, register it on our <a href=\"/pages/omegaindex\">Omega Index page</a> with the barcode on your collection card and the email you want your results sent to. Lost your barcode? Email <a href=\"mailto:nemo@seatopia.fish\">nemo@seatopia.fish</a> and we’ll help you find it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_safety": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "style": "with-background",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Before you use the kit",
            "page": "",
            "opened": false,
            "content": "",
            "liquid": "<p>Persons with bleeding disorders or taking blood thinners should consult with their physicians prior to using this kit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "sticky_buy_button": {
          "type": "sticky_buy_button",
          "settings": {}
        }
      },
